 LF=3D^<br><br><br>::Above 2 blank lines are required - do not remove<br><b=
r>set ^"\n=3D^^^%LF%%LF%^%LF%%LF%^^"<br><br>set callMacro=3Dfor /f "tokens=
=3D1-26" %%a in<br><br>set macro=3Ddo (%\n%<br>&nbsp; setLocal enableDelaye=
dExpansion %\n%<br>&nbsp; echo in macro prior to loop: a=3D%%a %\n%<br>&nbs=
p; for /l %%a in (1,1,3) do echo inside inner macro loop: a=3D%%a %\n%<br>&=
nbsp; echo in macro after loop: a=3D%%a %\n%<br>&nbsp; set "rtn=3DReturn Va=
lue" %\n%<br>&nbsp; echo variable in macro to return: rtn=3D!rtn! %\n%<br>&=
nbsp; for /f "delims=3D" %%v in ("!rtn!") do set "%%~a=3D%%v" %\n%<br>)<br>=
<br>set macro<br><br>set var=3D<br>echo before call to macro: var=3D%var%<b=
r>%callMacro% ("var") %macro%<br>echo after call to macro: var=3D%var%<br><=
/code></pre></div><br>Output:<br><div class=3D"codebox"><p>Code: <a href=3D=
"https://www.dostips.com/forum/viewtopic.php?f=3D3&amp;t=3D1827#">Select al=
l</a></p><pre><code>macro=3Ddo (<br>&nbsp; setLocal enableDelayedExpansion<=
br>&nbsp; echo in macro prior to loop: a=3D%a<br>&nbsp; for /l %a in (1,1,3=
) do echo inside inner macro loop: a=3D%a<br>&nbsp; echo in macro after loo=
p: a=3D%a<br>&nbsp; set "rtn=3DReturn Value"<br>&nbsp; echo variable in mac=
ro to return: rtn=3D!rtn!<br>&nbsp; for /f "delims=3D" %v in ("!rtn!") do s=
et "%~a=3D%v"<br>)<br>before call to macro: var=3D<br>in macro prior to loo=
p: a=3Dvar<br>inside inner macro loop: a=3D1<br>inside inner macro loop: a=
